      "text": "Venom isn’t slowing down,it's expanding its toolkit and setting up for a much bigger phase of digital infrastructure.\n\nFor years, Venom has delivered what governments, banks, and enterprises need most: low fees, massive scalability, and real-time performance.\nNow, they’re building on that foundation again.\n\nAdoption is already taking shape:\n– The Philippines is using Venom in its national digitalization plans\n– The UAE runs its carbon credit system on Venom\n– A major fintech company in China is in active discussions\n\nAnd now comes the major upgrade.\n\nx402 is coming to @VenomFoundation\nThis integration will allow automated systems to settle payments instantly no delays, no congestion, just direct execution on the network.\n\nFor developers\nA simplified SDK is on the way, supporting JavaScript, Python, Rust, Go, and more.\nA few lines of code will be all it takes to connect.\n\nThis upgrade strengthens Venom’s core strengths and opens space for new tools and advanced system interactions.\n\nWith dynamic sharding and a target of 500,000 daily transactions, Venom is ready for the next level of demand.\n\nA new chapter is unfolding and this move sets the pace for what comes next.\n\nYou can also check out the campaign on @BingXOfficial with $13,000 up for grabs\nJoin here: https://t.co/WytxjYmxXG\n\n#BingXSpotBlast",
